@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@userId = 1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "arenaId": 1,
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "12:00"
}

### Get my bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/my
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Get booking by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Cancel booking
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/cancel
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Double booking (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "arenaId": 1,
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "12:00"
}